  "notes": "{煮込|にこ}む means to simmer or stew food slowly, allowing flavors to blend thoroughly.\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n{煮|に}る (to boil/cook) + {込|こ}む (into, thoroughly) - the {込|こ}む adds the nuance of cooking deeply or for an extended time.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: カレーを{煮込|にこ}む\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {弱火|よわび}で{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer over low heat\n- じっくり{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer thoroughly\n- {味|あじ}が{染|し}みるまで{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer until flavors soak in\n\nCOMMON DISHES:\n- {煮込|にこ}みうどん: stewed udon\n- {煮込|にこ}みハンバーグ: hamburger steak in sauce\n- {牛|ぎゅう}{すじ|すじ}の{煮込|にこ}み: simmered beef tendon",
